diff --git a/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..2d49895d
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/2577.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@
+Fixed the TLS connection to an HTTPS proxy using ``ssl_context`` instead of
+``proxy_ssl_context`` when ``use_forwarding_for_https=True``. Only
+``proxy_ssl_context`` is used to connect to proxies now. Specifying
+``ssl_context`` together with ``use_forwarding_for_https=True`` now raises
+a ``ValueError``.
